        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ellsworth \"Bumpy\" Johnson, Dutch Schultz, Lucky Luciano, Laurence Fishburne, Tim Roth, Andy García, Davina\n- Works: Hoodlum, \"So Good\"\n- Concepts: modern organized crime in the United States, the Commission\n\nFacts:\n- The film Hoodlum concentrated on Ellsworth \"Bumpy\" Johnson, Dutch Schultz, and Lucky Luciano.\n- Laurence Fishburne portrayed Ellsworth \"Bumpy\" Johnson in Hoodlum.\n- Tim Roth portrayed Dutch Schultz in Hoodlum.\n- Andy García portrayed Lucky Luciano in Hoodlum.\n- Lucky Luciano is considered the father of modern organized crime in the United States for establishing the first Commission.\n- Davina's 1997 single \"So Good\" became the theme song for the film Hoodlum.",
